{"1954840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fractured Sanity", "steam_appid": 1954840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You wake up in a cell inside the Triton Institute. The staff is gone. The halls are not empty.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Matthew Simmons built this place to study Freud’s tripartite psyche — the id, the ego, and the superego — and how far a person can be broken before nothing human remains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/66c2fa55dc332d25d738a4c919592a04.poster.avif?t=1776898765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/66c2fa55dc332d25d738a4c919592a04.webm?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/66c2fa55dc332d25d738a4c919592a04.mp4?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remastered</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every model, texture, and environment rebuilt for the remaster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded locations with brand-new areas not seen in the original release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully reworked soundtrack and sound design with immersive 3D spatial audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined gameplay and major improvements based on feedback from the original version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/09cfb3555aeb455730a49208106cf3b4.poster.avif?t=1776898765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/09cfb3555aeb455730a49208106cf3b4.webm?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/09cfb3555aeb455730a49208106cf3b4.mp4?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a physics-driven VR world where objects can be picked up, examined, and used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles by paying attention to the smallest details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the history of the Institute and the fate of its patients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/481fe53539a3597fe65ab7aad90c0959.poster.avif?t=1776898765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/481fe53539a3597fe65ab7aad90c0959.webm?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/481fe53539a3597fe65ab7aad90c0959.mp4?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce ammunition — this is not a shooter, every bullet matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weapon handling: reload, aim, and fire under pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the horrors still wandering the halls of the Triton Institute</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/377b33748f5face91574b972e5d588cb.poster.avif?t=1776898765\" width=848 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/377b33748f5face91574b972e5d588cb.webm?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/377b33748f5face91574b972e5d588cb.mp4?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A note from the team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractured Sanity Remastered is the result of a small, passionate VR team pushing the game further with the help of new art and audio partners. We’ve reworked a huge part of the experience, fixing many of the issues from the original release and bringing the game closer to the vision we always had for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That said, we’re still a small team of VR enthusiasts, and with so many different hardware setups out there, occasional issues may still happen. If you run into anything unexpected, please reach out to us on Discord or social media. We take every report seriously, and your feedback helps us keep improving the game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You wake up in a cell inside the Triton Institute. The staff is gone. The halls are not empty.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Matthew Simmons built this place to study Freud’s tripartite psyche — the id, the ego, and the superego — and how far a person can be broken before nothing human remains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/66c2fa55dc332d25d738a4c919592a04.poster.avif?t=1776898765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/66c2fa55dc332d25d738a4c919592a04.webm?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/66c2fa55dc332d25d738a4c919592a04.mp4?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remastered</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every model, texture, and environment rebuilt for the remaster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded locations with brand-new areas not seen in the original release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully reworked soundtrack and sound design with immersive 3D spatial audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined gameplay and major improvements based on feedback from the original version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/09cfb3555aeb455730a49208106cf3b4.poster.avif?t=1776898765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/09cfb3555aeb455730a49208106cf3b4.webm?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/extras/09cfb3555aeb455730a49208106cf3b4.mp4?t=1776898765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a physics-driven VR world where objects can be picked up, examined, and used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles by paying attention to the smallest details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the history of the Institute and the fate of its patients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\