aph\" >That said, we’re still a small team of VR enthusiasts, and with so many different hardware setups out there, occasional issues may still happen. If you run into anything unexpected, please reach out to us on Discord or social media. We take every report seriously, and your feedback helps us keep improving the game.</p>", "short_description": "Wake up in a notorious asylum and survive the mind-shattering experiments of Dr. Matthew Simmons. Fractured Sanity Remaster rebuilds the VR horror experience with improved visuals, expanded areas, and reworked spatial audio.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/85efafede1e81a296aa6b47a2bd8f100e8329df6/header.jpg?t=1776898765", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/9bce8ae80977dd274be33931a7716c7ebeeab05c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776898765", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954840/9bce8ae80977dd274be33931a7716c7ebeeab05c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776898765", "website": "https://fracturedsanity.unitedgames.com.br", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Standing or Room Scale</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a